+- **#252 Gorn Patrol Ship:** Reference balance for reserved patrol use; trading and routine deployment remain disabled. Availability: reserved-gorn.
+- **#253 Hirogen Hunter:** Armor, pursuit and tractor support fit the hunter role; cargo is intentionally limited. Availability: general.
+- **#254 Hirogen Warship:** Heavy hunting-pack command hull exchanges agility for durability and striking power. Availability: general.
