+- **#270 Onyx Class:** Slow independent guard cruiser trades speed and range for armor and practical cargo. Availability: general.
+- **#271 Parliament Class:** Parliament is an advanced operations and engineering platform, not an assault flagship. Availability: general.
+- **#272 Speeder:** Fastest courier gives up armor, shielding, cargo and weapons to achieve its speed. Availability: general.
