+- **#284 Constitution III Class:** Constitution III emphasizes expedition capacity and survivability rather than maximum assault damage. Availability: general.
+- **#285 Duderstadt Class:** Duderstadt uses a fast, shielded reconnaissance fit with less freight space than explorers. Availability: general.
